    "memory_id": "nkm_mem_01J9R2C0P6Y8N3D1X7K4M9Q2JA",
    "text": "Observed failure mode: partial writes when a memory_id is missing; fix by wrapping memory_modify in a single transaction and pre-validating all ids.",
