    "memory_id": "nkm_mem_01J9R2D9K1H0B6R3S8V2N7X5CU",
    "text": "Graph traversal defaults: depth=2 and relations='*' are too expensive on large tenant graphs; require explicit depth 1..5 and allow relation_type filters.",
